
  An4rch OS live environment

  Install:   anarch-os-install
  Rescue:    anarch-rescue        (roll back a system that won't start)
  Wi-Fi:     iwctl               (station wlan0 connect "Network")
  Recover:   photorec            (get deleted files back from an erased disk;
                                  save them to a different drive)

  Desktop stuck?  Ctrl+Alt+F2, log in as root (no password), then run anarch-os-install
